# The two provenance manifests are checksummed byte-for-byte (MANIFEST.csv is
# itself listed in SHA256SUMS), so git must never rewrite their line endings.
# Without this, a checkout on Windows converts LF to CRLF and the checksum test
# fails there and only there.
inst/extdata/MANIFEST.csv -text
inst/extdata/SHA256SUMS   -text
